<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s204S">Because you have <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w1">coveted</span> what others have, then <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w3">each and every</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w2">good thing</span> you ever manage to find starts to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w8">get worse</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w9">less and less</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w11">never</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w10">more</span>, each one of them, with the passing of each of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w4">four seasons</span>, and in every <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s204w5">month</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s204w7">even</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s204w6">day by day</span>.</span>
